{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0097614","isObsolete":false,"name":"dinoflagellate hypocone","definition":{"text":"The part of a dinoflagellate cell below the cingulum; also referred to as the posterior portion of a dinoflagellate cell. It is separated from the epicone by the cingulum.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"URL","dbId":"http://tolweb.org/Dinoflagellates/2445"},{"dbCode":"Wikipedia","dbId":"Dinoflagellate#Morphology"}]},"comment":"The term name refers to a taxonomic group to make the label unique with respect to similarly-named anatomical structures.","synonyms":[{"name":"hypocone","type":"broad"},{"name":"hyposome","type":"related"},{"name":"hypotheca","type":"related"}],"children":[{"id":"GO:0097684","relation":"part_of"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0110165 (cellular anatomical structure)"},{"timestamp":"2019-09-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044464 (obsolete cell part)"},{"timestamp":"2015-12-09","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-13","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"hypocone"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-13","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"dinoflagellate hypocone"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-11","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"hypocone"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-11","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"hypotheca"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-11","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"hyposome"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-11","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044464 (obsolete cell part)"},{"timestamp":"2014-06-11","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The part of a dinoflagellate cell below the cingulum; also referred to as the posterior portion of a dinoflagellate cell. It is separated from the epicone by the cingulum."}],"xRelations":[{"id":"CL:0000000","term":"cell","namespace":"CL","url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ontology-lookup/?termId=CL:0000000","rel